Per-generator binary F1 ranges from 0.633 (Mistral-7B) to 0.724 (Pythia-2.8B; std.\ dev.\ 0.028), with the primary difficulty at the gen-1\,/\,gen-2+ boundary (Appendix~\ref{app:confusion}).

